  "id": "tower-ruin",
  "options": [
    {
      "option": "R1",
      "label": "R1 · Toppled mast",
      "note": "PROPOSED. The tower is blown at its foot and the mast TOPPLES: the same lattice as the standing tower (the unit sheet's) tips over about its base through eight drawn angles in 1.6 s, a second burst of dust where it lands, then it lies broken in two places, members snapped and missing, the platform at the far end. What stays at the foot: a scorched blot with a crater, the four footings cracked and shifted (one gone), leg stumps bent outward, the hut roofless with a torn roof across the hole, the cable snapped. A thick column of the damage smoke rises from the base for about eighteen turns, thinning and greying.",
